WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.370
- You also have two sons.

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:03.690
So that's, I have a
boy and boys are crazy.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:06.250
They like to just, it's like
little Tasmanian devils.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.530
So, I mean, have they, have
they picked up on anything,

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:11.510
any of your habits I hear they maybe have,

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.208
and is it a healthy habit?

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:15.650
- I think it's a fun habit.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.410
You know, I've got two boys.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.470
I am 42 years old and I, to this day,

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:25.303
believe that the funniest thing
in the world is our farts.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:31.580
And so I almost the first
opportunity that I had, basically,

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.740
as soon as they could
like move their hands,

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:39.370
I had them pulling my finger and you know,

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.440
they're six and three years old now.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.070
And even the six year old, I still, he,

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:44.930
they still believe I
don't want them to walk in

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:46.181
and hear this,

00:00:46.181 --> 00:00:50.330
but they still believe that
they are actually pulling the

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:53.160
gas out of me by pulling my finger.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.090
And we just laugh and laugh.

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:56.750
It is just fantastic.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:57.583
- I love it.

00:00:58.560 --> 00:00:59.860
It's like such a.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:01.611
- They have it.
- Such 14 year old humor.

00:01:01.611 --> 00:01:02.444
- They're like my finger.

00:01:02.444 --> 00:01:03.277
Oh, it's just so much fun.

00:01:03.277 --> 00:01:07.400
- Oh God I love you, but we'll
do you, people has asked me,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.930
you know, oh, if your kids are singers,

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.410
do people ask you about your kids?

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:12.243
Like if they were actors,

00:01:12.243 --> 00:01:13.700
would you be into that or not?

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.350
- Not right now.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:18.440
You know, I was, I was a kid actor.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:19.950
I started when I was five years old.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:21.730
So it is pretty surreal.

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:22.563
You know, my son is,

00:01:22.563 --> 00:01:23.700
my oldest is six now.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.210
So it's crazy to look at him
and know that at his age I was

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:30.137
working professionally and
had an agent and everything.

00:01:30.137 --> 00:01:30.970
- Wow.

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:32.800
And so I have no regrets.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:35.170
I'm incredibly grateful for my experience.

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:38.830
And it, it has everything
to do with where I'm at now

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:39.663
in my career

00:01:39.663 --> 00:01:40.730
having that experience.

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:42.610
But I would not put them
in it now that's for sure.

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:45.930
But if they want to, when
they get older, you know,

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:48.610
they're both little hams, you know,

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:52.133
they certainly seem to have
inherited some performance,

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:54.250
you know, inclinations.

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:56.030
So we'll see.

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:57.920
- Well, just from this
interview, I can tell you,

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.410
they get the humor from you.

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:00.243
I haven't met her,

00:02:00.243 --> 00:02:02.270
but so they're going to be funny.

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:03.590
- She's way funnier than I am.

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.000
She's way funnier than I am.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.300
- Oh my God, I love her already.

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.300
All right, well wait.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.730
You are, you were speaking about
how you were a child actor.

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:11.940
So you were in some fast food commercials

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.150
when you were a kid?

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:13.983
- Yeah, yeah.

00:02:13.983 --> 00:02:15.046
- How was that?

00:02:15.046 --> 00:02:15.879
- I've been in all kinds of commercials.

00:02:15.879 --> 00:02:19.010
- How was that though It's awkward, right?

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:21.290
- Yeah, it's, it's kind of awkward.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:22.123
I actually did do,

00:02:22.123 --> 00:02:25.360
I did one fast food commercial
where a major lesson was

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:26.483
imparted on me.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:32.340
I had to eat a burger
in every take, you know,

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:37.620
this beautiful looking beautifully
prepared burger for this

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:38.670
fast food chain.

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:41.550
And I ate and they kept
coming in after we cut.

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:42.690
And they were like, do
you want to spit it out?

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:44.120
Do you want to throw it away?

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:44.980
And I would just be like, no,

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:46.300
this is awesome.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.370
I could eat burgers all day.

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.250
And I just would stuff my face.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.083
And of course,

00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:52.720
by the end of the day I was sick.

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:53.750
I didn't eat.

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:56.710
it was like on December 23rd
and we filmed it right around

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:57.543
the holidays.

00:02:57.543 --> 00:03:00.150
And I remember I didn't
eat another full meal until

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.410
Christmas dinner.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:04.820
And so I, now anytime
I have to eat something

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:06.950
in any scene whatsoever,

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:11.070
I immediately dispose of
it after camera stops.

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:13.330
So, you know, listen, that's a,

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.997
it's a big lesson and I hope
that I've just imparted it on,

00:03:15.997 --> 00:03:19.430
you know, other upcoming
actors out there watching.

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.593
- You're welcome.

